Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:49.54,Announcement,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The operation will begin at 0630 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:51.46,Announcement,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We will now begin loading the prototype torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.51,0:01:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just stupid... And a smart girl like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I made the wrong decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.31,0:01:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.45,0:02:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, is it true that Yuki is an Iscandarian?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.58,0:02:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's even stupider.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.84,0:02:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,These were her thoughts...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.59,0:02:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...as she entrusted her sister with a dangerous mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You may learn the truth during your voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.23,0:02:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But do not let that sway you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.23,0:02:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Until we meet again, safe travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.44,0:02:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The salvation of all intelligent life...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.82,0:02:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the path of Iscandar...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.45,0:02:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We are already thirty-five days behind schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.25,0:02:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we use this subspace gate,\Nwe can shave off 30,000 light years.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:02:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The system satellite that controls the gate is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.80,0:03:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The question is whether we can take control of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The core contains records of a race...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.89,0:03:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A race, which controls the system satellite, different than that which built the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who controls it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It contains their name, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Out with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.66,0:03:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was seconds from destroying the Yamato. Why have you recalled me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.13,0:03:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Early this morning, our Leader's ship was destroyed through sabotage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.30,0:03:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Desler has been assassinated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Only two people knew he would be visiting Balun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,One is Admiral Ditz, the Supreme Commander of Astrofleets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And the other is yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.27,0:04:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You are here because I am accusing you of plotting the Leader's assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.74,0:04:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.03,0:04:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Ditz worked to assassinate the Leader and take control of the Empire, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.62,0:04:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've no time for childish fantasies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fantasies, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.17,0:04:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though your wife has been arrested?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.94,0:04:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Elisa? What has she done?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't know? She's been part\Nof an anti-government movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be some mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.35,0:04:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what everyone says.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Order is the foundation of any nation, and it must be maintained.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.56,0:04:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,For that to happen, anyone suspected of wrongdoing must be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.98,0:04:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There can be no exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.65,0:04:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimleh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall take a vote. Gentlemen of the jury?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Death! Death! Death!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.49,0:04:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,By unanimous verdict, the tribunal sentences General Domel to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.76,0:05:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're set to leave for the naval review. Has something good happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.78,0:05:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Domel has been sentenced to death...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Launch the fleet. Our target is Balun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:05:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone attempting to run will be shot on the spot. Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.33,0:06:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the subspace gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look functional...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it really propel us tens of thousands of light years at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.97,0:06:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I can't do anything with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.31,0:06:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,However, at this rate, it will affect ship functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is maintaining the ship a doctor's duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, explain...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do this? It isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.49,0:06:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:07:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, you would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Orders from Central Command...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't what I'm asking!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.46,0:07:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"You need the courage to disobey an order you believe is wrong."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I once told Kodai that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have been honest with ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will assume full responsibility for its disclosure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.49,0:07:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed that Mori's an alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, really...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.58,0:07:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Type 100 is ready to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Kodai went for protection, why would the XO take Mori?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.03,0:08:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's because she's an Iscandarian?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true! She is not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.86,0:08:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But she had that message from Starsha...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.37,0:08:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She also has no memories from over a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.95,0:08:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop speculating!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the middle of a mission. No talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.29,0:08:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The Type 100 has entered the system satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There don't appear to be any booby traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.85,0:08:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like a long-abandoned base.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If the inertial mass system is on-line, the rest must still be functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be useful. We'll bring it back on board later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.91,0:08:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.75,0:09:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know which way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.71,0:09:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.58,0:09:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say a civilization older than that of Garmillas made this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.92,0:09:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they'd be upset that the Garmillans have tainted it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"The sadness of being tainted makes the snow fall once more," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.89,0:09:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Chuya Nakahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.15,0:09:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I once knew someone who loved that poem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't he a twentieth-century poet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.96,0:09:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A poet from over two hundred years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.61,0:09:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.41,0:09:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think the Iscandarians knew about this Nakahara guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Could the Iscandarians have known such an ancient poet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they left guard dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.99,0:10:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.07,0:10:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.82,0:10:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He always was that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I didn't know what to do, he'd show me the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.32,0:10:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Here are the papers you requested.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.09,0:10:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that the alien fleet has reached Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So I hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.85,0:10:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The rumor is they've upgraded Inner Planet War shelters, and everyone's evacuated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.19,0:10:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.57,0:10:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll soon be starting a big operation to defend Mars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.65,0:11:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that information?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.74,0:11:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you want? You can't enter this lab without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.46,0:11:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.38,0:11:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm bringing materials Sanada requested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.38,0:11:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.18,0:11:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you'd like to read these.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A book of poems?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought equations were his only interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.43,0:11:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.31,0:11:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Kodai, your friend is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.15,0:11:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! I promised to meet my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.96,0:11:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He does whatever he feels like, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.37,0:11:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's honest with himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You could learn a thing or two from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.17,0:11:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.09,0:12:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Honest with yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I was able to prove you're an Earthling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.43,0:12:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you have to be, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.02,0:12:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, why don't I have any\Nmemories from beyond a year ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it just a coincidence that's when Yurisha disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.49,0:12:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.70,0:12:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.16,0:12:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Yurisha were involved in the same accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.42,0:12:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether an accident or terrorism... No one really knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.09,0:12:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But in that incident, you lost your memory, and Yurisha went into a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.60,0:12:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We did all we could, but she never woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:13:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We still don't know where in the Large Magellanic Cloud Iscandar is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But we have the map they sent!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.11,0:13:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. That data's been entered\Ninto the Automatic Navigation System.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.91,0:13:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And the location doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.41,0:13:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,She showed us the path to Iscandar. Or she was meant to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.46,0:13:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! But then, how could we have come this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We've followed her memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.26,0:13:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yurisha is the core of the Automatic Navigation System.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been searching for Iscandar by tracing her memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.53,0:13:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that it's ethically wrong,\Nand that we must take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.53,0:13:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why we will bring her home safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's part of the Yamato's mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:14:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that message capsule...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.09,0:14:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.64,0:14:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.18,0:14:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.18,0:14:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.89,0:14:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.23,0:14:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The system satellite control area.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.29,0:14:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of this is my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.84,0:14:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,XO Sanada! XO Sanada!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,XO Sanada!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.61,0:15:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.28,0:15:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If we restart the system satellite, we can open the subspace gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been locked from inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.06,0:15:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that restarting the system will cause a massive neutron burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.55,0:15:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But this area is shielded.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.97,0:15:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, you'll be safe there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it shielded?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.81,0:15:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.44,0:15:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.65,0:15:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.57,0:15:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try to undo the lock myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.95,0:15:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the door, Sanada!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:15:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai, I said I had a friend who liked Chuya Nakahara's poetry, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That friend was Mamoru Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.75,0:16:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother, Mamoru Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.13,0:16:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You were my brother's friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.60,0:16:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}If you're looking for her, Niimi's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.60,0:16:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Another meteorite. This time on Rio de Janeiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly, they're being sent by the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The aliens have changed their strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.36,0:16:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, want to get some air for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.29,0:16:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky looks terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be a nuclear winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,After you graduate, you're joining the Cosmo Navy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.38,0:16:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, how about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.25,0:16:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Me... I'm not cut out for the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.55,0:16:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think there must be something I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.85,0:17:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find something...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.02,0:17:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find something I couldn't do in a million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.11,0:17:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,A poem and an equation. Those are what we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.28,0:17:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We both wish to protect this world in different ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.07,0:17:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,In that respect, we're the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.74,0:17:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"The sadness of being defiled,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.91,0:17:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,causes snow to fall once more."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.08,0:17:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanada!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He was my friend, and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.59,0:17:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't tell him that Operation M was a decoy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.95,0:17:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,that the whole fleet was a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.94,0:17:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,930)}Good luck, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The operation begins in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.28,0:17:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how many ships will make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.41,0:18:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll take out Pluto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.79,0:18:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get to see Niimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.71,0:18:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We broke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.46,0:18:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I never got the chance to return this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'd like you to keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've read it twice, and I still don't\Nunderstand why anyone likes poems.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't hold back, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that it was a decoy operation was top secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't have the courage to tell my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.38,0:18:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I just obeyed my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.43,0:19:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of man I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.31,0:19:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he'd known, he would've gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.52,0:19:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what the situation...\NNo matter how unreasonable the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.94,0:19:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If he'd decided to do it, he would.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That is how my brother was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's the way he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mamoru, your brother is following in your footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.41,0:19:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanada, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know my brother liked poetry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.21,0:19:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.59,0:19:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"The sadness of being tainted longs for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.61,0:19:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun sets helplessly with the sadness of being tainted."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.85,0:19:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanada, what made my brother happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.56,0:19:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What made him sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Neutrons have flooded the control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.95,0:20:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No one could have survived it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanada!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.25,0:20:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The door is open...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the path to the mother world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.89,0:20:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,XO!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.27,0:20:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Sanada?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.52,0:20:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to learn more about my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And more about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.33,0:20:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanada!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.63,0:20:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Neutrons don't pass through water easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You really do amaze me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention all crew. The gate is online.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato will now be able to jump 30,000 light years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.67,0:21:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But before we do, I must make something clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.80,0:21:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a rumor about an Iscandarian aboard this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.35,0:21:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.69,0:22:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But she is not a crew member.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.02,0:22:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She is asleep in the automatic navigation room.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.53,0:22:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Yurisha Iscandar?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.70,0:22:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, now I am myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.83,0:22:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Yurisha of Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.62,0:24:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Balun. A lighthouse in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.33,0:24:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The center of a network that connects the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.33,0:24:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,A gigantic enemy fleet gathers, numbering 10,000 in all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.21,0:24:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato sets a course straight through for the Large Magellanic Cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.68,0:24:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: Over the Black Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.81,0:24:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 273 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.53,0:22:29.45,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1079,1073)\blur7.5\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&}Out of the Forest of Memory{\fad(1800,1500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.53,0:22:29.45,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1322,840)\blur7.5\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&}Episode 17{\fad(1800,1500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.43,0:15:11.77,tsing 2,,0,0,0,,{\frz3.5\fax-0.12\pos(990,489)}{\blur1.5}Neutron Radiation: High
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:17.31,tsing 2,,0,0,0,,{\frz349.7\pos(992.572,475.286)}{\blur1.8\c&H93821D&}Do you want to lock bulkhead D?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.23,0:10:31.69,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\pos(960,1035)}-Seven Years Ago - AD 2192-{\fad(1050,650)}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.87,0:16:18.25,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\pos(960,1035)}-Six Years Ago - AD 2193-{\fad(1050,550)}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:49.59,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\pos(960,1035)}-10 Months Ago - Far East Sector Underground Dock-{\fad(1050,550)}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.35,0:21:29.81,tsing 5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1081.715,427.286)\frz349.6\blur1}{\fax-0.03}Chuya Nakahara Poems
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:22.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.13,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:30.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:35.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:44.36,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:51.91,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:01:00.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:05.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:16.18,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.55,0:22:54.23,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}No matter how steep or far the road is
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:58.52,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I will not give up
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.69,0:23:07.37,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Endless tears flowing down my cheek are not
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.37,0:23:12.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}A white flag of surrender
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.66,0:23:24.38,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}I go and become the wings of a loved one
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.47,0:23:28.76,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}Gather up the shattered dream
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.76,0:23:34.39,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}And take it to the end of the universe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.39,0:23:37.35,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.35,0:23:39.86,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Row strongly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:46.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}And hold your thoughts close to your chest
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.57,0:23:50.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Steady as she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.45,0:23:54.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Through your despair
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.29,0:24:02.55,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1000)}A ray of light shines
